{"id":"ads_14","book":"ads","bookLabel":"Daily Ads report","title":"Creative Playbook","tables":[{"cols":["A","Y"],"rows":[["Creative playbook – which audience and which creative for which event","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Built from every ad since Sep 1 (to Sun Nov 22) and refreshed daily. FVV, 3VV, 5VV and Install are judged on CPI; Purchase and RT on cost per purchase. \"Target\" = the median of the cheapest quarter of ads for that event. Genres are ASSUMED from the ad copy – please correct them in the last table (PM columns).","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],[],["1. Ideal set-up per event","","","","","","","","","","","","","","Adjust (purple): all campaigns of the event since Sep 1 (matured cohorts). Ret Effective CPI = Adjust CPI ÷ retention index.","","","","","","","","","",""],["Event","Judged on","Spend since Sep 1","Event CPI / CPP","Best audience","Best duration","Best genre (assumed)","Hook target (past 15 s)","Midroll target (25%→75%)","Cliffhanger target (75%→end)","CTA target (clicks / 100 ThruPlays)","Cheapest ads (proof)","How to build it","Confidence","D1 retention","D7 retention","D30 retention","Retention vs target","Meta CPI (₹)","Adjust CPI (₹)","Ret Effective CPI (₹)","PM: Agree?","PM comment history","New PM comment (Mon Nov 23)","Row key (do not edit)"],["FVV","Adjust CPI","₹1,171,048","₹16.0","Interest + Broad – ₹15.7 (-2% vs event)","~5 min – ₹12.8 (-20% vs event)","Relationship drama – revenge – ₹12.3 (-23% vs event)","13% (all ads 12%)","73% (all ads 58%)","50% (all ads 48%)","12.1 (all ads 12.1)","Daddy's New Wife_2min / HBBM_2min_broad (~10 min, Broad): ₹5.8\nHisaab Barabar_5min_broad / Hisaab Barabar_5min_broad (~5 min, Broad): ₹10.1\nBESC_5min / HBBM_10min_Broad (~5 min, Broad): ₹10.8","Long free previews win: 5-min and 10-min cuts give the cheapest installs, 30-s cuts the dearest. Broad beats interest. Revenge (Hisaab Barabar) and mystery (Daddy's New Wife / Double Trouble) are the cheapest genres; action (Deva / Rakshak) the dearest.","High","14.1%","2.93%","0.61%","0.97","₹11.7","₹16.0","₹16.5","","","","ideal:FVV"],["3VV","Adjust CPI","₹1,113,273","₹18.8","Advantage+ / other – ₹18.1 (-4% vs event)","~10 min – ₹15.1 (-20% vs event)","Mystery – family secret – ₹16.4 (-13% vs event)","13% (all ads 13%)","62% (all ads 56%)","45% (all ads 43%)","11.4 (all ads 9.9)","Daddy's New Wife_2min / HBBM_2min_Broad (~10 min, Broad): ₹6.9\nDaddy's New Wife_2min / AW_2min_Broad (~10 min, Broad): ₹7.8\nAccidental Wife_2min / AW_2min_Broad (~2 min, Broad): ₹11.0","Needs people who keep watching: 10-min and 2-min cuts; 30-s cuts are ~20% dearer. Broad (or interest+broad) over pure interest. Romance-twist (Accidental Wife) and mystery are cheapest; action and rom-com dearest.","High","17.3%","3.84%","0.70%","1.20","₹14.2","₹18.8","₹15.7","","","","ideal:3VV"],["5VV","Adjust CPI","₹73,216","₹24.6","Broad – ₹24.3 (-2% vs event)","~30 s – ₹23.6 (-4% vs event)","Mystery – family secret – ₹26.1 (+6% vs event)","14% (all ads 14%)","41% (all ads 51%)","45% (all ads 41%)","19.1 (all ads 9.4)","Loan_Trap_2min_Broad – Copy / AW_2min_Broad (~2 min, Broad): ₹11.6\nLoan_Trap_2min_new / DT_30s_Broad (~2 min, Broad): ₹12.6\nDeva_30sec_Broad / AW_2min_Broad (~30 s, Broad): ₹17.4","Still thin (₹9.8k since Oct 21, CPI ~₹23). The Double Trouble 30-s cut is cheapest (₹18.8); the Accidental Wife 2-min cuts ₹23–25. Mystery beats romance-twist here so far; judge on CPI after ₹5k per ad set.","Medium","16.1%","3.15%","0.53%","1.11","₹17.1","₹24.6","₹22.2","","","","ideal:5VV"],["Install","Adjust CPI","₹25,756","₹19.6","Advantage+ / other – ₹19.6 (+0% vs event)","~10 min – ₹12.7 (-35% vs event)","Relationship drama – revenge – ₹45.0 (+130% vs event)","16% (all ads 8%)","72% (all ads 64%)","68% (all ads 66%)","10.3 (all ads 22.1)","DNW_18_06_26_Creative_02 / Daddy's_New_Wife_18_06_26_SET_1 (~10 min, Advantage+ / other): ₹9.5\nCPR_19_06_26_Creative_03 / CPR_19_06_26_SET_1 (~5 min, Advantage+ / other): ₹12.8\nBillionaire_Babhi_18_06_26_Creative_4 / Billionaire_Babhi_18_06_26_SET_1 (~5 min, Advantage+ / other): ₹14.1","Only small Advantage+ install tests so far (₹14k). Long (5–10 min) mystery cuts were cheapest; rags-to-riches and action were dear. Re-test with the FVV winners before scaling.","Medium","8.8%","2.12%","0.30%","0.60","₹15.3","₹19.5","₹32.3","","","","ideal:Install"],["Purchase","Cost per purchase","₹813,147","₹495","Interest – ₹445 (-10% vs event)","~2 min – ₹440 (-11% vs event)","Mystery – family secret – ₹387 (-22% vs event)","7% (all ads 7%)","47% (all ads 46%)","37% (all ads 38%)","10.4 (all ads 11.3)","Hero Beta Baap Mechanic_2min – Copy / HBBM_2min_Interest (~2 min, Interest): ₹187\nZinda_HuMai_2min_Int / Zinda_HuMai_2min_Int (~30 s, Interest): ₹246\nDT_2min_Interest / DT_2min_Interest (~2 min, Interest): ₹272","Interest audiences give cheaper purchases than broad; 2-min cuts beat 30-s, 5-min and 10-min. Mystery (Double Trouble) and the HBBM 2-min cut are the cheapest; romance-twist (Accidental Wife) the dearest for purchases even though it is cheap for installs.","High","15.1%","2.97%","0.49%","0.96","₹43.0","₹53.5","₹55.5","","","","ideal:Purchase"],["RT","Adjust CPI","₹17,469","₹150.6","Retargeting – ₹150.6 (+0% vs event)","~5 min – ₹126.0 (-16% vs event)","Unmapped – ₹134.5 (-11% vs event)","6% (all ads 6%)","65% (all ads 42%)","61% (all ads 61%)","20.5 (all ads 9.6)","HB_5min / Opened_but_not in 5D (~5 min, Retargeting): ₹115.5\nLKR_2min / FVV&3VV_Inactive (~2 min, Retargeting): ₹149.4\nSiya Ram_5min / Opened_but_not in 5D (~5 min, Retargeting): ₹178.4","One live retargeting campaign (₹36k, ~₹310 per purchase – cheaper than prospecting). 2-min and 5-min cuts of a show the user has not watched. Low data – provisional.","Medium","17.8%","3.46%","0.32%","1.01","₹41.6","₹53.8","₹53.5","","","","ideal:RT"],[],["2. What a good hook, midroll, cliffhanger and CTA look like","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Part","What good looks like","","","","","","FVV target","3VV target","5VV target","Install target","Purchase target","RT target","","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Hook","First 3 s = the conflict itself (slap, insult, \"yeh meri maa hain!\", dulha bhaag gaya). No logo or slow build-up; a face and a line of dialogue on screen in frame 1. Measured as % of plays that watch past 15 s (ThruPlay).","","","","","","13%","13%","14%","16%","7%","6%","","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Midroll","Escalate every 15–20 s with a new reveal or reaction shot; cut establishing shots and dead air. Measured as % of people at 25% of the video who reach 75%.","","","","","","73%","62%","41%","72%","47%","65%","","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Cliffhanger","End on an unresolved question (\"aakhir yeh guard hai kaun?\"), freeze on the reaction face – never on a resolution. Measured as % of people at 75% who reach the end.","","","","","","50%","45%","45%","68%","37%","61%","","","","","","","","","","","",""],["CTA","End card \"Agla episode FREE – TukTuki app\" with the show name, also said in the voice-over; primary text ends with \"Dekhiye TukTuki app par\". Measured as link clicks per 100 ThruPlays and clicks that become installs / purchases.","","","","","","12.1 clicks/100","11.4 clicks/100","19.1 clicks/100","10.3 clicks/100","10.4 clicks/100","20.5 clicks/100","","","","","","","","","","","",""],[],["3. Which audience for which event","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""],["Event","Audience","Spend","Share of event","CPI / CPP","vs event","CPI (all)","Hook","Midroll","Cliffhanger","CTR","Click → result","Ads","Verdict","","","","","","","","","","",""],["FVV","Broad","₹711,628","61%","₹15.7","-1%","₹11.4","12%","61%","55%","1.25%","19.3%","40","OK","","","","","","","","","","",""],["FVV","Interest","₹249,463","21%","₹16.5","3%","₹12.3","14%","63%","44%","1.24%","21.2%","11","OK